# S3 (mer3ly site canvas plan, Rulings 144-148): a host history in the plain
# viewer, stepped by checkpoint. Run with the site's published history:
#   dataset.html?dataset=fixtures/site-repository-host-history.json
# The history has 15 checkpoints and compares label, class, status and
# pushed_at (Ruling 145) and relationship endpoints and kind (Ruling 146).
# The viewer opens on the last; each node's title carries its change's mark
# (+ added, ~ updated, · stable), and the History region tells every change,
# removed occurrences included, with the checkpoint as the slider's value.
assert snap ready == true
settle 3
assert snap dataset == loaded
assert snap history-checkpoints == 15
assert snap history-index == 15
assert snap nodes == 21
assert snap edges == 30
assert snap reader-checkpoint ~ Checkpoint 15 of 15
assert snap history-summary ~ 16 updated
assert snap reader-changes >= 21
assert snap reader-change-labels ~ Mere: updated (pushed_at)
assert snap reader-item-names ~ ~ Mere
assert snap reader-item-names ~ · Wavicle
# The buttons step one checkpoint.
click role:button Earlier checkpoint
settle 2
assert snap history-index == 14
assert snap reader-checkpoint ~ Checkpoint 14 of 15
assert snap history-summary ~ 13 stable
assert snap reader-change-labels ~ Cleromancy: updated (class, label, relations)
# A press on the slider picks the checkpoint under it: the middle of 15.
click role:slider
settle 2
assert snap history-index == 8
assert snap nodes == 19
# The keys: Home and End go to the ends, the arrows step.
key Home
settle 2
assert snap history-index == 1
assert snap nodes == 1
assert snap edges == 0
assert snap reader-item-names ~ + Graphshell
key ArrowRight
key ArrowRight
key ArrowRight
key ArrowRight
settle 2
assert snap history-index == 5
assert snap nodes == 3
assert snap history-summary ~ 1 removed
assert snap reader-change-labels ~ Graphshell: removed
assert snap reader-item-names ~ ~ Mere
capture tree_host_history_removed
key End
settle 2
assert snap history-index == 15
assert snap nodes == 21
capture tree_host_history
wait
log host history viewer receipt complete
